The task concerns a dead-letter destination on an "orders pipeline", most likely a Cloudflare Queue, since dead letter queues are configured on queue consumers. In Cloudflare Queues, the dead letter queue is set in the consumer settings, so the consumer needs updating. Cloudflare Pipelines has no dead-letter concept; the pipelines tools cover sinks, streams, and the pipeline itself.

The first step is to look at the existing consumer for the orders queue. The consumer list or update tool would show or change its dead_letter_queue setting, and queues_consumers_list is the call that reveals the current consumer config.

{"tool":"queues_consumers_list"}
